WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.880
The A to Z of isms - Xenophobism

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.120
Xenophobia is a term used to describe
the fear and hatred

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.400
of the foreign "other".

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.800
It is a fear that the other,
the less deserving foreigner,

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.560
will take away your way of life.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.880
Xenophobia has a long history.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.280
The Romans and Greeks labelled those
outside their borders as barbarians

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.600
uncivilised brutes who needed
to be conquered

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.280
for fears of them
contaminating the empire.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.080
And xenophobia is shaping
the political debate today.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.480
In the campaign for Britain
to leave the EU,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.880
we were starkly warned about the
threat of the hordes of foreigners

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:37.080
supposedly swarming to the border
of fortress Britain.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.760
The prime minister at the time
of the vote, David Cameron,

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.520
ushered in Brexit, in part by badly
misjudging the power of xenophobia

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.360
when he assumed that people
would not ...

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.200
Across the Atlantic, Donald Trump
was elected on a wave of xenophobia

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.320
against the imagined ...

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.320
… supposedly pouring across
the border with Mexico.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.160
{\an2}"Build the wall" is the perfect
slogan of our xenophobic times.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:07.600
Though it would be wrong to confuse
xenophobia with racism,

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.160
though the two are often related.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.720
Racism is more than
the fear of the other.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.040
It is a system of oppression based
on the belief that so-called races

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.320
are superior to others.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.720
Just as much of the Brexit vote

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.000
was based on the desire to curb
white migration into Britain,

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.720
we have seen xenophobia in places
like South Africa,

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.840
where migrants from other
African countries

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.240
have been violently attacked
by other black people,

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.800
who are themselves poor
and lacking in opportunity.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.320
It is a logic of scarce resources -

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.760
of the country being too full
to sustain the outsiders.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.160
And a reminder that you can
be a victim of racism

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.840
and perpetrate xenophobia.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.600
The Windrush scandal was caused
by the hostile environment

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.760
a xenophobic policy aimed at
squeezing out illegal immigrants

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.880
by making checks of documents routine
in all areas of life,

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.920
including work, education
and even visiting the doctor.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.840
The unsurprising result was that
many, including those who had legally

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.760
come from the Caribbean post-war,

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.240
lost their jobs or were deported to
countries they had long left behind.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:10.000
But it was also the logical
conclusion of decades of immigration

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.920
policy that purposefully
restricted immigration

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.240
from Britain's former colonies in the
Caribbean, Asia and Africa.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:19.840
The expansion of freedom of movement
from Europe was a continuation

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:24.280
of welcoming white migration, whilst
closing the door on people of colour.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:27.920
Xenophobic fears are easy to stir
when inequality increases.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.440
The pain the so-called natives
feel through poverty and inequality

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.360
are turned onto the foreigner
trying to jump the queue.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.200
It is no coincidence that following
that increased inequality

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.240
since the 2008 financial crisis,

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.880
xenophobia has been on the rise
across the world.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.400
Thankfully there is a way
to tackle this trend.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.560
When society is more equal
and provides for all,

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.560
there is no need to fear the other.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:54.680
Thanks for watching! :)

